      <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Peristaltic Pump Head: Types, Specs &amp; How to Choose</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-300">The pump head is the heart of any peristaltic pump — the part that squeezes the tube, drives the flow and decides accuracy, tube life and maintenance cost. Here's everything you need to spec one correctly.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-400">By Ray Chan · Updated August 2026 · ~15 min read</p>
